<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2" xmlns:gx="http://www.google.com/kml/ext/2.2">
<Document>
	<name>UC Berkeley Student Housing · 4 projects · spirals · 08-29 19:00</name>
	<description><![CDATA[Every UC housing project flagged uc_project in v2, largest first, flown north to south. Opens east of the Campanile, then at each site: plan view 14 s, spiral in 42 s over 1.25 turns, close orbit 30 s. UC housing is counted in BEDS, not units. Altitudes derive from each building's extrusion in geometry.kml, so a corrected height re-cuts the shot. Camera-only: run build_tour_package.py to splice the geometry.]]></description>
